       send the above separately<br>
       <br>
       <br>
       Adding a table in mysql:
       <br>
       CREATE TABLE alternaterealitydb.tblmessage (ID INTEGER UNSIGNED NOT NULL DEFAULT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY)
       <br>
       send the above separately
       <br>
       <br>
       Adding a column to hold file data on mysql (mssql uses type IMAGE):
       <br>
       ALTER TABLE alternaterealitydb.tblmessage ADD messagecol BLOB
       <br>
   </p>

